        },
        {
          "text": "En oloyo luker ducu cakke wa i kulu Euprate nio kwede i lobo pa jo Piliciti, ki i wan lobo me Ejipt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.26",
